    "/collector": {
      "source": "web/collector.html"
    }
  },
  "assetRoots": [
    "web",
    "runtime_pages"
  ],
  "notes": "Runtime manifest v11 makes Chat frontend-first: the locally stored shell/theme can paint immediately while server/LALM/account connectivity settles independently. Ice Dragon v15 persistently caches its companion and adult source on-device and can promote the adult wallpaper to a cached 4320x7680 WebP during idle time on capable devices. Manifest v12 adds the runtime-owned Frozen Web Collector page at /collector; compatible collector page and engine updates require no subsequent server deployment."
}
